# My Precious: "Equipped creature has hexproof and can't be blocked. Equip-{2}, Pay 2 life." Bot1's Elvish Mystic is equipped on turn 3
# for exactly two mana (Ruby, Emerald) and 2 life (20 -> 18). Then Bot2 may not Bolt it (hexproof) and its own Elvish Mystic, untapped
# and able to block, may not block it, so the 1/1 connects for 1 (CR 702.11b, 509.1b, 702.6a, 118.8).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Elvish Mystic
My Precious
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Elvish Mystic
Lightning Bolt
Island x3
Island x10

